COMPILATION OF: E52D

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52D

   1 a 0000 E52D:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-52/P1] BINARY OUTER / DEC INNER (homonym i): outer i
   4 a 0006      fixed bin, inner i fixed dec(7,2), both i = 3. Lexical
   5 a 0006      resolution: the OUTER store is an immediate (no cell), the
   6 a 0006      INNER store takes a 4-byte target-precision cell -- pool 4,
   7 a 0006      DATA 4 + 2 + 4 = 10. A global outer-wins map types the inner
   8 a 0006      store BINARY: NO pool cell at all -- pool 0, DATA 6. DATA-SIZE
   9 a 0006      discriminates. MINE refuses today (Vint vs Vdec clash). */
  10 c 0006   dcl i fixed bin;
  11 c 0006   i = 3;
  12 c 000C   call q;
  13 c 000F   q: procedure;
  14 e 000F      dcl i fixed dec(7,2);
  15 e 0012      i = 3;
  16 c 0023      end q;
  17 a 0023 end E52D;

CODE SIZE = 0026
DATA AREA = 000A
FREE SYMS = 38A8
END  COMPILATION
